<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EchoAgent - 基于 ECHO 协议的能力资产化</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --bg-card: #1e293b;
            --text: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border: #334155;
            --accent: #22d3ee;
        }
        
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #0f172a 50%, #1e1b4b 100%);
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99,102,241,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes rotate {
            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .tagline {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: rgba(99,102,241,0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        
        .section-title::before {
            content: '';
            width: 4px;
            height: 28px;
            background: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        
        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .concept-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .concept-item {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
        }
        
        .concept-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .concept-item h4 {
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .concept-item p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        th, td {
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        
        th {
            background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        
        code {
            background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        pre {
            background: #0d1117;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .architecture {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .arch-layer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .arch-box {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .arch-box.user { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); }
        .arch-box.gateway { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #22d3ee); color: #0f172a; }
        .arch-box.bridge { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #fbbf24); color: #0f172a; }
        .arch-box.chain { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #34d399); color: #0f172a; }
        
        .arch-label {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .arch-desc {
            font-size: 12px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .flow-arrow {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        
        .highlight {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-top: 60px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .logo { font-size: 40px; }
            .tagline { font-size: 18px; }
            .arch-layer { flex-direction: column; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="logo">EchoAgent</div>
            <p class="tagline">基于 ECHO 协议的 AI Agent 能力资产化</p>
            <span class="badge">v0.2 · 2026-03-30</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">一句话定位</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <p>一个让 <span class="highlight">AI Agent 能力（Skills）</span> 成为可交易 <span class="highlight">ECHO 资产</span> 的协议层，连接 OpenClaw 执行引擎与 ECHO 链上结算。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">核心概念映射</h2>
            <div class="concept-grid">
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>ECHO 资产 → Skill</h4>
                    <p>一个 OpenClaw Skill 映射为链上 ECHO 资产</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>mint() → 注册</h4>
                    <p>将 Skill 能力上链，生成 ECHO 资产</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>rentEcho() → 租用</h4>
                    <p>用户支付费用，获得 Skill 使用权限</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>useECHO() → 执行</h4>
                    <p>用户触发 Skill 执行，触发分润</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>createDerivative() → 衍生</h4>
                    <p>基于已有 Skill 克隆/微调出新 Skill</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>DerivRevenueDistributed → 版税</h4>
                    <p>父代 Skill Owner 持续获得子代使用费分成</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">为什么是 Skill 而不是 Agent？</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>层级</th>
                        <th>定位</th>
                        <th>可资产化</th>
                        <th>说明</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>Skill</code></td>
                        <td>单一独立能力单元</td>
                        <td><span class="highlight">✅</span></td>
                        <td>最小资产单元，开发者可自由定义粒度</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>Agent</code></td>
                        <td>Skills + Prompt + Model 的组合</td>
                        <td><span style="color: #ef4444;">❌</span></td>
                        <td>产品形态，引用 Skills，不直接资产化</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>Session</code></td>
                        <td>Agent 实例化后的会话</td>
                        <td><span style="color: #ef4444;">❌</span></td>
                        <td>运行时状态</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">系统架构</h2>
            <div class="architecture">
                <div class="arch-layer">
                    <div class="arch-box user">
                        <div class="arch-label">User 用户层</div>
                        <div class="arch-desc">普通用户 / 渠道合作方 / 场景应用开发者 / Skill Owner</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-arrow">↓ 通过 Feishu / Web / API 等渠道交互</div>
                <div class="arch-layer">
                    <div class="arch-box gateway">
                        <div class="arch-label">OpenClaw Gateway</div>
                        <div class="arch-desc">交互接入层 · Session 管理 · 路由到对应 Skill 执行</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-arrow">↓ Bridge（桥接层）</div>
                <div class="arch-layer">
                    <div class="arch-box bridge">
                        <div class="arch-label">EchoAgent Bridge</div>
                        <div class="arch-desc">链上 ↔ 链下同步引擎 · 权限同步 · 执行记录 · 分润触发</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
                <div class="arch-layer">
                    <div class="arch-box chain">
                        <div class="arch-label">ECHO 合约层</div>
                        <div class="arch-desc">链上结算层 · 资产租赁 · 分润分配 · 衍生管理</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Skill ECHO 资产结构</h2>
            <pre><code>struct SkillAsset {
    uint256 tokenId;           // ECHO 资产 ID
    string name;               // Skill 名称
    string description;        // 能力描述
    string uri;                // 指向 Skill 配置
    address owner;             // 资产所有者
    bool isExtensible;         // 是否允许衍生
    uint256 allowedShare;      // 衍生时分润上限
    string category;           // 分类：weather, doc, image
    string version;            // 版本号：1.0.0, 2.1.0
}</code></pre>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">计费模式</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>模式</th>
                        <th>ECHO 对应</th>
                        <th>适用场景</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>TimesBased</code> 按次</td>
                        <td><code>rentEcho(tokenId, useTimes)</code></td>
                        <td>零散任务、单次咨询</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>DurationBased</code> 时长</td>
                        <td><code>rentEcho(tokenId, durationUnits)</code></td>
                        <td>包月/包年订阅、持续服务</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>SceneBased</code> 场景分润</td>
                        <td><code>useECHOOf() + sceneShare</code></td>
                        <td>第三方应用接入、渠道分发</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">分润规则</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <p>每笔执行费用分配：</p>
                <br>
                <p><span class="highlight">用户支付</span> → 平台费 → 场景分润 → Owner</p>
                <br>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px;">
                    衍生 Skill 执行时，Owner 获得剩余部分的 <span class="highlight">N%</span> 作为版税给父代（如 5%）
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">角色权限</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>角色</th>
                        <th>可以做什么</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>普通用户</td>
                        <td>租用 Skill、查看使用记录</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Skill Owner</td>
                        <td>注册/注销 Skill、定价、审批授权、收取分润</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>场景应用</td>
                        <td>申请接入、经 Owner 审批后调用</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>渠道合作方</td>
                        <td>分享 Skill、获得 sceneShare 分润</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>衍生 Skill Owner</td>
                        <td>创建衍生 Skill、支付 upfrontFee 给父代</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>平台方</td>
                        <td>收取平台费、处理争议、管理合约升级</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">实现路径</h2>
            <div class="concept-grid">
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>阶段一：MVP</h4>
                    <p>跑通「注册 → 租用 → 执行 → 分润」全流程</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>阶段二：多 Skill 协作</h4>
                    <p>Agent 引用多个 Skills + 场景接入 + 渠道分润</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-item">
                    <h4>阶段三：去中心化</h4>
                    <p>DAO 治理 + 信誉评分系统 + 跨链支持</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>EchoAgent · 基于 ECHO 协议构建</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px;">OpenClaw Agent 能力资产化设计方案</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>